msgid "Archived: Improving the Capabilities of Your Multicopter"
msgstr "存档：提升您的多旋翼性能"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:7
#: 906ee62c55dd40abb3084466cf0fb59c
msgid ""
"This page describes one of our members (Euan Ramasy's) highly advanced "
"photographic quadcopter. It illustrates the incremental improvements he has "
"been and is making to better optimize its performance and usefulness and "
"serves as an excellent example for how to properly undertake development and"
" improvement of your own copter for your own uses."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍了我们一位成员（Euan "
"Ramasy）高度定制的航拍四轴飞行器，展示了他为优化飞行性能和实用性所持续进行的渐进式改进，是如何合理开发和改进自己的飞机以满足特定用途的优秀示范。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:16
#: 0c0edb3ae96f4d0fa88a201eefd3b79c
msgid ""
"If you are just starting and this is your first MulitiCopter you are in the "
"wrong place, go here: :ref:`Build Your Own Multicopter <build-your-own-"
"multicopter>`."
msgstr ""
"如果您刚刚起步，这是您的第一架MulitiCopter，那么您来错地方了，请前往：:ref:`Build Your Own Multicopter "
"<build-your-own-multicopter>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:20
#: 996337b52fdb4a068455f76e15c9dc97
msgid "Copter Upgrading Goals"
msgstr "飞机升级目标"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:22
#: 69f4a7069f8e48b384737081c4f3c371
msgid ""
"Well it's been a year since I built my first quad (selecting APM, "
"naturally), and I've decided to do a bit of an upgrade in the off season."
msgstr "距我组建第一架四轴（自然选择了APM）已过去一年，我决定在淡季进行一些升级。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:25
#: 2c5dad57fe2c46c490294be362cad307
msgid "There were four objectives to the exercise:"
msgstr "此次改造有四个目标："

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:27
#: aa4f66b03aeb4b4d9136c16fd412f61b
msgid "better reliability"
msgstr "提高可靠性"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:28
#: c4aef5d0bff24318a8967d2b281fa02e
msgid "simplify"
msgstr "简化"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:29
#: 2fb337c85feb4a19b0154d827f0cf435
msgid "reduce weight"
msgstr "减轻重量"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:30
#: a07aa4a77d2e4b41895dd63ea6b8acaa
msgid "improve performance"
msgstr "提升性能"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:33
#: c3add48e36c1409c83224b5e5f2e8611
msgid "Better reliability"
msgstr "更高的可靠性"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:35
#: 4ef3c53be35347c58f4c759325640612
msgid ""
"Added 40A ESC's, giving me 15A overhead (formally 30A on a 25A max draw)"
msgstr "更换为40A ESC，获得15A余量（原先30A ESC在最大25A电流下使用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:37
#: 208e2599328a42628abdc9638eda6fd4
msgid ""
"Replaced 5V BEC with a 5.5V, after getting occasion chirp from Spektrum "
"telemetry about low volts."
msgstr "将5V BEC更换为5.5V，因为Spektrum数传偶尔提示电压过低。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:39
#: 601dd84fb599472795eec2f99b230769
msgid "Re-wired the PDB and the ESC's for better RF"
msgstr "对PDB和ESC的接线进行了优化，以改善射频性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:40
#: 28f00208ec7f4381a27f7c22b965a4a7
msgid "Replaced 1 motor that sounded less than optimal"
msgstr "更换了1个声音异常的电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:41
#: 54a53dc52b064368bc24feff96912fcb
msgid ""
"ESC's now uprated (if you can \"uprate \"to HobbyKing...:-)) and outboard "
"for cooling and better security."
msgstr "ESC已升级（如果能称之为\"升级\"到HobbyKing……:-）），并移至外侧以便散热并提高安全性。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:45
#: 41da35dc0b3e4deea52ecd77dcac0b2c
msgid "Simplicity"
msgstr "简化"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:47
#: 9071350497ac403295ba313ad6eccd88
msgid "Number of battery circuits reduced from 3 to one."
msgstr "电池回路数量从3路减少到1路。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:48
#: b9b80aad81f04c919207c39e973c7adc
msgid "New 5.5V and 12V BEC's used"
msgstr "采用新款5.5V和12V BEC。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:49
#: cf0cb31c28044c6ebdc708666ab9d440
msgid "Unnecessary LED's dumped."
msgstr "去掉了不必要的LED。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:51
#: 760fd336905f4f98bef9fe41196cf401
msgid "Only retained 4 for orientation on the odd occasion I don't FPV."
msgstr "只保留了4个用于在偶尔不使用FPV时判断方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:52
#: 1618692387be4d2ab00eb3740c6d5d6b
msgid "But they are Braincube's and are **very** bright!"
msgstr "但那些是Braincube的，**非常** 亮！"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:53
#: 4fc9eae9d0f4474392f975492526e050
msgid "Labeled everything."
msgstr "对所有部件进行了标注。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:54
#: a7bb19ad960f481facbe06ca12e17144
msgid "Here is the controller:"
msgstr "以下是控制器："

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:60
#: 333f3b422d0c4b89a0679c10957a829b
msgid "Reduce weight"
msgstr "减轻重量"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:62
#: 09f7076ac0644f9fa34499d744eea3ad
msgid "Reduced battery circuits from 3 to 1."
msgstr "电池回路从3路减为1路。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:63
#: 11730c94e86c4c5da8f6d4a20b432ea8
msgid "EzOSD replaced with minimOSD."
msgstr "EzOSD更换为minimOSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:64
#: a2c99277541a470dbaf58d0dbf1e0bb8
msgid ""
"Also in picture: an FPV camera switcher and the Telemetry junction box."
msgstr "图中还有：FPV摄像头切换器和数传接线盒。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:70
#: f19e33ddeb124ee18692f402be79ef2c
msgid "LED circuits dumped"
msgstr "去掉LED回路。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:72
#: 88f424ace7c54240bd96d58cce5864e6
msgid "Spektrum telemetry TM1000 dumped"
msgstr "去掉Spektrum数传TM1000。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:73
#: 92278f9b12f942e7b157a54574bbdbe2
msgid "GPS finder dumped"
msgstr "去掉GPS定位器。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:74
#: ea3e65b07f9343c3a6adff1d2c4a4680
msgid "Leg components replaced with Carbon Fibre"
msgstr "起落架部件更换为碳纤维材质。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:75
#: b34d1cfbe69e45a0a4784c31553bfcdb
msgid "And did it work?"
msgstr "效果如何？"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:77
#: b2f8692a62e944ff8a61eca90097799d
msgid ""
"Starting weight: 3.65kg -> Final weight: 3.62kg - so savings mostly consumed"
" by improved brushless gimbal."
msgstr "起始重量：3.65kg -> 最终重量：3.62kg——节省的重量基本被升级后的无刷云台抵消了。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:79
#: 215d3081a5d3486e915f2fb1bc0abb13
msgid ""
"If I'd stayed with the quadframe brushless (refused to tune with Martinez "
"board!) and dumped the Braincube as well, I would have saved over 200g."
msgstr "如果我继续使用quadframe无刷云台（拒绝用Martinez板调参！）并去掉Braincube，本可以节省超过200g。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:84
#: d9dd10780f564ca6a39d8ff5e837bbd9
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "性能"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:86
#: 4631ade75e8e48b3a3fbbe37698ecace
msgid ""
"Moongel replaced with zeal. Unfortunately vibes actually went up! I now hit "
"the +/-5 \"safe\" limits in high power flight and maneuvers."
msgstr "将Moongel更换为zeal减震垫，但震动反而增大了！在大油门飞行和机动时，我的震动值碰触到+/-5的\"安全\"限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:89
#: 64cdb0791ee6435d940188fd5abff05f
msgid "However, it does seem to respond to very small commands much better."
msgstr "但对非常细小的指令输入响应似乎有所改善。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:91
#: 0b3fc84ecd954776b0fd3dc8d00111c6
msgid "The zeal is firmer than moongel so I might expect that."
msgstr "Zeal比Moongel更硬，这可能是意料之中的结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:93
#: 1e85dea116f8448eb010cb0d3d42a2dd
msgid ""
"PID's retuned after 3.0.1, to increase YAW control, and to decrease "
"pitch/roll (only by 7%) to improve video footage."
msgstr "3.0.1版本后重新调整了PID，增大了偏航控制，并将俯仰/横滚降低（仅7%）以改善视频画质。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:96
#: 98d1432b40624a07b2788af5ff78f925
msgid "It still handles well, but it's now more \"Transit\" than \"Cosworth\" ."
msgstr "飞机操控性依然良好，但现在更像\"Transit\"而不是\"Cosworth\"了。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:98
#: f8fb9555efe34b2a8aeedabcb7dec30f
msgid ""
"For our american cousins, this translates to: \"it's more light truck than "
"corvette\")."
msgstr "对美国朋友来说，这相当于：\"更像轻型卡车而不是科尔维特\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:101
#: 0248a18ed91244f7a4c19634c2acbf2a
msgid "6S Current sensor added. Means"
msgstr "增加了6S电流传感器，这意味着："

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:103
#: 72b7564449274493ab5a37fad8be2aa0
msgid "Compassmot can now be run in CURRENT not THROTTLE."
msgstr "Compassmot现在可以在CURRENT模式下运行，而非THROTTLE模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:104
#: 2d4999ac07824787aea1804234c12eae
msgid "Flight is noticeably more accurate, especially in RTL, Loiter."
msgstr "飞行精度明显提升，尤其是在RTL和Loiter模式下。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:106
#: 1a59e9a9b75c40e09589f783759c4842
msgid "Higher GPS pole added."
msgstr "提高了GPS杆的高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:108
#: dd1519740fcd486aad03db020ed95a7a
msgid "Compassmot reduced from 4% to 1%."
msgstr "Compassmot从4%降低到1%。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:110
#: e1e5d2d712c446198f1abe313a135b93
msgid "Quadframe gimbal replaced with RCTimer."
msgstr "将Quadframe云台更换为RCTimer。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:112
#: a27390879f8b40c28aada1bd5066ad8f
msgid "Video quality immediately improved."
msgstr "视频质量立即得到改善。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:113
#: 16c55fda81834651a88b079bc0484514
msgid ""
"The original Quadframe brushless gimbal just refused to take a tune, and "
"never performed well."
msgstr "原来的Quadframe无刷云台始终无法完成调参，性能一直不佳。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:117
#: 1ba68f9dbebd455eac10e4d49a199abb
msgid "Receiver with 2 Satellites"
msgstr "带2个卫星接收机的接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:119
#: ab1693c1ebd94356840b5a5e52c7d82a
msgid "Radio diversity added via Orangerx 800 (DSMX) + 2 satellites."
msgstr "通过Orangerx 800（DSMX）+ 2个卫星实现无线电分集。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:120
#: 4089f41af00b4d0aa459b7d7de8be27f
msgid ""
"Each satellite has a 30cm cable, one mounted far out under one arm, one as "
"far down on the leg as possible."
msgstr "每个卫星有30cm线缆，一个安装在某个机臂下方尽量靠外处，另一个尽量安装在起落架最低处。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:122
#: 95035b9b25914fcbba50df2d9d565f8b
msgid ""
"It's not perfect, but better than before. Radio now much more reliable "
"regardless of orientation. No more scary moments..."
msgstr "虽不完美，但比以前有所改善。无论飞机姿态如何，无线电现在更加可靠。再也不会出现惊险时刻了……"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:129
#: cb6a65d89f634a60b0cc4de6eb82bdd0
msgid "FPV Transmitter Improvements:"
msgstr "FPV发射器改进："

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:131
#: ee15d1cfcbe546c3ae92361db2800875
msgid "Video TX moved to as far down the legs as possible."
msgstr "视频发射器移至起落架尽量靠下的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:132
#: e8fe6d5859894a42903325b53e884562
msgid ""
"Range has improved from 350m to well over 600 with 600mw tx + ibcrazy "
"omni's."
msgstr "范围从350m提升到600m以上，搭配600mw发射器和ibcrazy全向天线。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:135
#: 1bad090b6bc04d1e8b76e673b6727b32
msgid ""
"Will be pushing out further, as I now have an ibcrazy 5 turn helical antenna"
" to play with as well."
msgstr "传输距离还将进一步提升，因为我还有一个ibcrazy 5匝螺旋天线可以使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:138
#: b84f14e6bc25482294ce3b29c498b107
msgid ""
"Also to come: 1/4 wavelength 433mhz antenna's for long range telemetry."
msgstr "即将推出：用于长距离数传的1/4波长433mhz天线。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:141
#: f07e04c92d7c4bffbf51516ddbed6be3
msgid "How bad is it? It cuts out before the video does..."
msgstr "有多糟糕？无线电信号断线比视频断线更早……"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:147
#: 79557bf2788e4c4fad4429168e7ec91e
msgid "Camera Gimbal Mount"
msgstr "摄像头云台支架"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:149
#: 542a008efa3546fd9897a7f5f4f62526
msgid "The Camera Gimbal Mount has had 3 upgrades."
msgstr "摄像头云台支架经历了3次升级。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:150
#: 1ea870e649a749568b96b76c869b31d5
msgid "Quadframe brushless gimbals motors replaced with RCTimer."
msgstr "Quadframe无刷云台电机更换为RCTimer。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:151
#: 86a064c7b92c4e1ea66df22e5410a279
msgid ""
"I replaced the battery plate with my own design, and I'm happy with that."
msgstr "我用自己的设计替换了电池板，对此非常满意。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:153
#: d79be535e08d4e928510c707fd344eb6
msgid "So happy I'm selling it to anyone who wants one."
msgstr "太满意了，以至于我愿意卖给任何想要的人。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:154
#: 41ada212834b44d6a1d2389bdc1a5976
msgid "I Also replaced the ball bearings with stiffer ones."
msgstr "我还将滚珠轴承更换为更硬的型号。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:155
#: 0f680a91e17941729789cfb370e81fff
msgid ""
"I still get a tiny bit of jitter in pitch, but I might need to look at my rx"
" feed into the martinez; it might be noisy."
msgstr "俯仰方向还有一点轻微抖动，但可能需要检查一下我输入到martinez控制板的rx信号，那里可能有噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:162
#: 82854bf3be7b42a6bb3309fa10065986
msgid "FPV Camera Improvements"
msgstr "FPV摄像头改进"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:164
#: 6e516ea9a2594da4bdb9bb7f7246176a
msgid ""
"Finally, I dumped the 420 line FPV camera, and went with the 650 line from "
"Security Camera 2000 (the one everyone goes for!)."
msgstr "最终，我放弃了420线的FPV摄像头，改用Security Camera 2000的650线摄像头（大家都选这款！）。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:166
#: 86deb7dffd194f6bb8db9e52015dc95c
msgid "I also got some  new low light lenses."
msgstr "我还购置了一些新的低光镜头。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:167
#: 464fee72ff974bc99f3b22b4b5a721ec
msgid "This setup just works so much better."
msgstr "这套配置效果好多了。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:168
#: 510d158aa1e64be4b870d50237cb998f
msgid ""
"Just a pity I can't get minimOSD to overlay on the feed for some reason; "
"works ok on the Gopro feed!"
msgstr "只可惜不知为何无法让minimOSD叠加到这路图像上；叠加到Gopro画面上却没有问题！"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:175
#: 82c7032ee72e431bb715e766566bd7e5
msgid "Summary:"
msgstr "总结："

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:177
#: 6619e37ada424bd188ef9cbe09549e0a
msgid ""
"Euan's highly developed QuadCopter had already delivered excellent service "
"as a brushless gimbal stabilized photographic platform with highly developed"
" FPV cpability."
msgstr "Euan高度定制的四轴飞行器已作为具有高度FPV能力的无刷云台稳定航拍平台出色地服役。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:180
#: de0cafba1db0479d92a9bb65f0d1d0b2
msgid "And now he has added several improvements."
msgstr "现在他又进行了若干改进。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:182
#: dcf764520f0147be8da96eda498e2da8
msgid ""
"The camera mount has been replaced with better gimbals, bearings and "
"mounting plate."
msgstr "摄像头支架已更换为性能更好的云台、轴承和安装板。"

#: ../../source/docs/improving-the-capabilities-of-your-multicopter.rst:184
#: 445639e976154b5cbc02b4af591753c0
msgid ""
